Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 06:32:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] yosemite4: pldm: log FRB2 watchdog details

Description
Log FRB2 watchdog events through the generic Logging.Create interface and
 include watchdog subtype and captured POST code history in AdditionalData.

Motivation
Record useful diagnostics when FRB2 watchdog events occur without adding
 a platform-specific D-Bus interface.
